flowchart TD
    sources["Read selected sources"] --> connect["Connect the work"]
    connect --> compare["Check what changed"]
    memory["Saved context"] --> compare
    compare --> brief["Draft the daily brief"]
    coverage["Show missing coverage"] -.-> brief
    brief --> review["I review the evidence"]
    review --> follow["I follow up with the team"]
    follow -->|Record confirmed decisions and the next check| memory
    %% detail sources: GitHub, public discussions, and approved chats
    %% detail connect: Link issues, PRs, and possible dependencies
    %% detail compare: Check commitments, review waits, and possible downstream impact
    %% detail brief: Sources, uncertainty, and proposed next steps
    %% detail review: Confirm links; accept, dismiss, or defer
    %% detail follow: Resolve questions with the responsible people
    %% detail memory: Confirmed decisions, dependencies, pause reasons, and next checks
    %% detail coverage: Name failed checks and the last successful refresh
